{{> Logo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title="This Address Already Has an Account" }}

{{!--
  Sent to the new address when someone asks to make it their account's and
  another account already uses it (#9821, Common's EmailChangeConfirmation).
  The page that asked says only that it is waiting for a confirmation, as it
  says for every address, so the person who typed it learns nothing from it;
  this email, to the address itself, is where it is said. Nothing changed,
  and there is no link to confirm.
--}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(concat "Someone asked to use this email address for another " (brandNameHtml) " account. This address already has an account, so it cannot be used for a second one, and nothing was changed.")}}

{{> InfoBlock info="If you asked for this, sign in with this address instead, or use a different address for the other account."}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=signInLink buttonText="Sign In"}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{#if requestedAt}}
{{> InfoBlock info="Details of the request:"}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Requested at:" plainText=requestedAt }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>Didn't ask for this?</strong> You can safely ignore this email. Your account is unchanged, and whoever typed your address was not told that it has an account."}}

{{> SupportBlock this }}

